"stage": "Writing",
"title": "Multi-turn EP encirclement in coupled STVOs (PRB)",
"summary": "Encircling exceptional points in a pair of coupled vortex STNOs: full range of gains, different encirclement loops, and amplitude death at high gain. Mostly experimental; extends Ho et al., Newton 2026 and Wittrock et al., Nat. Commun. 2024 with the same samples and theory.",
"facts": [
"EP mapping vs gain recorded on the combined output of both STVOs",
"Encirclement loops recorded with STVO A and STVO B read out separately (STNO1 = STVO A output, STNO2 = STVO B output; one device pair)",
"STVO A is the fixed oscillator (biased in C-state)",
"Gain dependence: four gains in the C-state configuration plus one C-state loop at lower gain; field 435 mT"
],
"next": [
